## MVP Features (Manual Input)
- Player registration: POST /api/tournaments/{id}/players
- Game creation: POST /api/tournaments/{id}/games (manual pairing)
- Result input: PATCH /api/tournaments/{id}/games/{gameId}/result
- Scoring: win=1, draw=0.5, loss=0
- Multiple winners: POST /api/tournaments/{id}/games/winners
- All winners (children): POST /api/tournaments/{id}/games/winners/all

## Do NOT ⛔
- **Do not write implementation code BEFORE tests** (TDD is mandatory!)
- **Do not commit code with less than 100% test coverage**
- Do not skip unit-tests for Service methods
- Do not skip integration-tests for Controller endpoints
- Do not use automatic pairing algorithms (MVP is manual)
- Do not modify Flyway migrations that are already applied
- Do not expose sensitive data in API responses
- Do not use deprecated Spring Security methods
